// ASF+SDF - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// ASF+SDF is Scala's build-definition language, in which a build is a
// value rather than a script. `name` is the only field here a
// person reads.
lazy val hello = project
  .in(file("."))
  .settings(name := "Hello World!")
